+## 1. Icons / Currency and Stats: export, sheet `sheet_hud_icons.png`
+
+**Why export:** these are custom vector shapes, and Roblox can't draw vectors.
+**Why one sheet:** the note says they are all shown together (top bar and stat cards).
+**Why white:** the note says they're tinted per state in game. `ImageColor3` multiplies the image
+colour, so the icons must be exported **pure white (#FFFFFF)**. The Figma colours become the default
+`ImageColor3` values.
+
+**Figma sheet frame:** 136 × 102, no fill. Place each 32 × 32 icon at `(1 + col × 34, 1 + row × 34)`
+and set its fill to white. Export at **2x → 272 × 204 px**.
+
+Sheet: 4 columns × 3 rows, cell 64 × 64, stride 68.
